     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Yihui posted the necessary fix at <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/30269537/reactive-serverside-shiny-datatable-with-extensions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/30269537/reactive-serverside-shiny-datatable-with-extensions&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398760964000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1XKuhfIrSOArMgfVYVB26t\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/30269537/reactive-serverside-shiny-datatable-with-extensions</a><div><br></div><div>My initial post didn&#39;t show that I was </div><div><div><ul><li>incorrectly using <span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">searching </span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">=</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(128,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">FALSE</span> as an option within DT::renderDataTable(options(...)) </li><li>incorrectly using <span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">rownames</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">=</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(128,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">FALSE</span> as a parameter to DT::renderDataTable(), instead of  <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">dataTableAjax</span> and <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">datatable</span></li></ul></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div><div><br>On Monday, May 18, 2015 at 11:10:03 AM UTC-4, Mark Miller wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks, that makes sense.  I must be doing something else wrong now, so I updated the SO question.<br><br>On Friday, May 15, 2015 at 6:23:52 PM UTC-4, Mark Miller wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>disclaimer:  crossposted from stackoverflow.<div><br></div><div><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I have made some (functional) shiny interfaces in which a reactive data object was used as the data argument inside of renderDataTable.</p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">dataSel4counts </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">({</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">if</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">targspec </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">!=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;&lt;ALL&gt;&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n    tsFilter </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> lendata</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">targ.spec </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">==</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">targspec\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">else</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n    tsFilter </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> rep</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> length</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">lendata</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">targ.spec</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  lendata</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> lendata</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">adjp </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">maxp </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&amp;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> tsFilter </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">]</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\noutput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">countTable </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> renderDataTable</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">({</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  data </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> dataSel4counts</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  datatable</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n    data\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">})</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">Recently I added several of the extensions documented on<a href=\"https://rstudio.github.io/DT/extensions.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(12,101,165)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rstudio.github.io/DT/extensions.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398760964000&amp;usg=AOvVaw08-CywtH96Ro0qjJGFgoML\">https://rstudio.github.io/DT/extensions.html</a></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I get the sense that (by default) client-side processing is a consequence of adding DT extensions.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I would like to switch back to server side processing, following <a href=\"http://rstudio.github.io/DT/server.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(12,101,165)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio.github.io/DT/server.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398760964000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0PZicIyCNZSbh-2KyFptNo\">http://rstudio.github.io/DT/server.html</a></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">But it seems like the data arguments (iris in the example) can&#39;t be reactive. When I try to do something like</p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">action </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> dataTableAjax</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">session</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> dataSel4counts</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">())</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nwidget </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> datatable</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">dataSel4counts</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> server </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> options </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> list</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  ajax </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> list</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">url </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> action</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">))</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I get a variety of errors, including</p><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px;padding:10px;border-width:0px 0px 0px 2px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(255,235,142);font-size:15px;quotes:none;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px;background-color:rgb(255,249,227)\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both\">Warning in run(timeoutMs) : You are using the server-side processing mode, but did not specify the &#39;ajax&#39; option. See <a href=\"http://rstudio.github.io/DT/server.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(12,101,165)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio.github.io/DT/server.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398760964000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0PZicIyCNZSbh-2KyFptNo\">http://rstudio.github.io/DT/server.html</a></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-size:15px;clear:both\">Error in .getReactiveEnvironment()$currentContext() : Operation not allowed without an active reactive context. (You tried to do something that can only be done from inside a reactive expression or observer.)</p></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div></div></div></div></div>"
    ]
