ut$maxp &amp; tsFilter ,  ]\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; })\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; output$countTable = renderDataTable({\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;   data &lt;- dataSel4counts()\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;   datatable(\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;     data\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;   )\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; })\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; Recently I added several of the extensions documented\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; onhttps://<a href=\"http://rstudio.github.io/DT/extensions.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio.github.io/DT/extensions.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398760966000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1FcDbFeK-ZwPrp_gYX1bt-\">rstudio.github.io/DT/extensions.html</a>\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; I get the sense that (by default) client-side processing is a consequence\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; of adding DT extensions.\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; I would like to switch back to server side processing, following\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; <a href=\"http://rstudio.github.io/DT/server.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio.github.io/DT/server.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398760966000&amp;usg=AOvVaw174sazKLw0wfYRkmoxwo39\">http://rstudio.github.io/DT/server.html</a>\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; But it seems like the data arguments (iris in the example) can&#39;t be\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; reactive. When I try to do something like\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; action = dataTableAjax(session, dataSel4counts())\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; widget = datatable(dataSel4counts(), server = TRUE, options = list(\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;   ajax = list(url = action)\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; ))\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; I get a variety of errors, including\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; Warning in run(timeoutMs) : You are using the server-side processing\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; mode, but did not specify the &#39;ajax&#39; option. See\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; <a href=\"http://rstudio.github.io/DT/server.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio.github.io/DT/server.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398760966000&amp;usg=AOvVaw174sazKLw0wfYRkmoxwo39\">http://rstudio.github.io/DT/server.html</a>\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; Error in .getReactiveEnvironment()$currentContext() : Operation not\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; allowed without an active reactive context. (You tried to do something that\r<br>&gt;&gt;&gt; can only be done from inside a reactive expression or observer.)\r<br>&gt;\r<br>"
